@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Cenário 1: Sucesso - Criação de Agendamento (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedulings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "serviceId": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333",
  "professionalId": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z"
}

### Cenário 2: Falha - Antecedência menor que 24h (RN01) -> esperado: 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedulings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "serviceId": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333",
  "professionalId": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444",
  "startsAt": "2026-10-27T10:00:00.000Z"
}

### Cenário 3: Falha - Identificador malformado -> esperado: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedulings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "uuid-invalido-123",
  "serviceId": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333",
  "professionalId": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z"
}